# Custom per-project read-only mounts for the Pi container.
# '|'-separated fields: project directory, host path, optional mount name. Mounts appear at
# /mnt/<basename of host path>, or /mnt/<custom name> with the third field. '~' or absolute paths, '#' starts
# a comment, spaces in paths are fine, '|' must not appear in paths.
#
# Examples:
# ~/Code/my_project | ~/Documents/my project specs
# ~/Code/my_project | /Volumes/External Data | specs
